    "end": 83.05,
    "action": "keep",
    "kind": "sentence",
    "reason": "kept: importance 74.7, role setup",
    "score": 60.7,
    "confidence": 0.7,
    "text": "And the troposphere is where we find most of our weather, all the cloud systems, are down here in the troposphere.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "thought": "t5"
   },
   {
    "id": "sentence:source:118.14-125.14",
    "sentence_id": "sentence:source:118.14-125.14",
    "src": "/home/user/new-project-money/.nexus/benchmarks/explainer/source.mp4",
    "start": 118.14,
    "end": 125.14,
    "action": "keep",
    "kind": "sentence",
    "reason": "kept: importance 82.4, role climax",
    "score": 65.9,
    "confidence": 0.7,
    "text": "Now the sun's radiation as it comes down it comes down in a couple of different forms one we call ultraviolet radiation.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "thought": "t11"
   },
   {
    "id": "sentence:source:145.26-151.02",
    "sentence_id": "sentence:source:145.26-151.02",
    "src": "/home/user/new-project-money/.nexus/benchmarks/explainer/source.mp4",
    "start": 145.26,
    "end": 151.02,
    "action": "keep",
    "kind": "sentence",
    "reason": "kept: importance 75.6, role climax",
    "score": 52.8,
    "confidence": 0.7,
    "text": "So we see this stuff coming down but if we don't see much of it get through the ozone layer.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "thought": "t13"
   },
   {
    "id": "sentence:source:151.48-160.26",
    "sentence_id": "sentence:source:151.48-160.26",
    "src": "/home/user/new-project-money/.nexus/benchmarks/explainer/source.mp4",
    "start": 151.48,
    "end": 160.26,
    "action": "keep",
    "kind": "sentence",
    "reason": "kept: importance 75.6, role climax",
    "score": 61.3,
    "confidence": 0.7,
    "text": "So about 90 % of what we call UVB, 90 % is absorbed by the ozone layer.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "thought": "t13"
   },
   {
    "id": "sentence:source:160.54-167.32",
    "sentence_id": "sentence:source:160.54-167.32",
    "src": "/home/user/new-project-money/.nexus/benchmarks/explainer/source.mp4",
    "start": 160.54,
    "end": 167.32,
    "action": "keep",
    "kind": "sentence",
    "reason": "kept: importance 89.0, role climax",
    "score": 72.2,
    "confidence": 0.7,
    "text": "There's another class called UVC, UVC, 100 % of the UVC.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "thought": "t14"
   },
   {
    "id": "sentence:source:167.42-173.26",
    "sentence_id": "sentence:source:167.42-173.26",
    "src": "/home/user/new-project-money/.nexus/benchmarks/explainer/source.mp4",
    "start": 167.42,
    "end": 173.26,
    "action": "keep",
    "kind": "sentence",
    "reason": "kept: importance 89.0, role climax",
    "score": 62.2,
    "confidence": 0.7,
    "text": "This is a very dangerous form of solar agents completely absorbed by the ozone layer.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "thought": "t14"
   },
   {
    "id": "sentence:source:214.96-223.75",
    "sentence_id": "sentence:source:214.96-223.75",
    "src": "/home/user/new-project-money/.nexus/benchmarks/explainer/source.mp4",
    "start": 214.96,
    "end": 223.75,
    "action": "keep",
    "kind": "sentence",
    "reason": "kept: importance 79.4, role climax",
    "score": 63.5,
    "confidence": 0.7,
    "text": "The interesting thing is the reason that stratosphere begins to warm up is because all of this radiation from the Sun is being absorbed in the ozone layer up here.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "thought": "t15"
   },
   {
    "id": "sentence:source:227.77-235.81",
    "sentence_id": "sentence:source:227.77-235.81",
    "src": "/home/user/new-project-money/.nexus/benchmarks/explainer/source.mp4",
    "start": 227.77,
    "end": 235.81,
    "action": "keep",
    "kind": "sentence",
    "reason": "kept: importance 78.1",
    "score": 62.5,
    "confidence": 0.7,
    "text": "There's almost no UV radiation that gets down here and so it gets pretty cold because there's no absorption of solar radiation here.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "thought": "t17"
   },
   {
    "id": "sentence:source:260.05-260.89",
    "sentence_id": "sentence:source:260.05-260.89",
    "src": "/home/user/new-project-money/.nexus/benchmarks/explainer/source.mp4",
    "start": 260.05,
    "end": 260.89,
    "action": "keep",
    "kind": "sentence",
    "reason": "kept: importance 84.4, role resolution, ending: resolution",
    "score": 60.4,
    "confidence": 0.7,
    "text": "That's the UV.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "thought": "t19"
   },
   {
    "id": "sentence:source:261.45-266.25",
    "sentence_id": "sentence:source:261.45-266.25",
    "src": "/home/user/new-project-money/.nexus/benchmarks/explainer/source.mp4",
