    "kind": "sentence",
    "reason": "kept: importance 84.4, role resolution, ending: resolution",
    "score": 60.9,
    "confidence": 0.7,
    "text": "And because you have very little absorption of UV here, it just gets cold.",
    "speaker": "narrator",
    "thought": "t19"
   },
   {
    "id": "sentence:source:267.05-276.03",
    "sentence_id": "sentence:source:267.05-276.03",
